WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.141 --> 00:00:02.641
(funky music)

00:00:03.678 --> 00:00:04.940
- Hey guys, I'm Jade.

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.980
And today we're gonna find
out if we dance better

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:09.129
when we're sober or when
we're a little tipsy.

00:00:09.129 --> 00:00:10.409
- I've danced pretty much my whole life,

00:00:10.409 --> 00:00:11.449
it doesn't mean I'm good.

00:00:11.449 --> 00:00:13.249
But dance doesn't have to be
good, it just has to be pure

00:00:13.249 --> 00:00:14.238
and from the heart.

00:00:14.238 --> 00:00:16.038
- I think I'm gonna be better drunk.

00:00:16.038 --> 00:00:17.198
That's the honest truth.

00:00:17.198 --> 00:00:20.438
And then you just, like,
let loose, feel the vibes.

00:00:20.438 --> 00:00:23.598
- We needed some unbiased
opinions to judge this fairly.

00:00:23.598 --> 00:00:26.137
So we brought in some
professional dancers.

00:00:26.137 --> 00:00:27.329
- I'm Bex Robinson.

00:00:27.329 --> 00:00:30.148
I have been dancing since
I was two, so 20 years.

00:00:30.148 --> 00:00:33.102
I love dance because it's a
form of expression and freedom

00:00:33.102 --> 00:00:36.428
and for me it's a way to
communicate without saying words.

00:00:36.428 --> 00:00:38.853
- What's going on everybody,
my name is Eugene Cho.

00:00:38.853 --> 00:00:40.591
I also go by @bboylooselee.

00:00:40.591 --> 00:00:43.932
I am 25 years old and I've
been dancing for 13 years.

00:00:43.932 --> 00:00:44.791
- In round one they're gonna dance

00:00:44.791 --> 00:00:46.410
to three songs completely sober,

00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:48.311
and they are gonna drink a
little bit, take a couple shots,

00:00:48.311 --> 00:00:51.412
then they're gonna the same
three songs again but drunk.

00:00:51.412 --> 00:00:53.662
(R&amp;B song)

00:00:57.932 --> 00:00:59.408
- I don't know what I'm doing!

00:00:59.408 --> 00:01:01.825
(funk music)

00:01:07.844 --> 00:01:10.594
Yo, this is the only move I know.

00:01:11.198 --> 00:01:14.031
(dancehall music)

00:01:19.448 --> 00:01:20.962
- Dance like nobody's watching.

00:01:20.962 --> 00:01:22.525
- Oh that's the problem,
you guys are watching.

00:01:22.525 --> 00:01:24.415
(laughs)

00:01:24.415 --> 00:01:26.924
Oh my god, I don't know, I'm like...

00:01:26.924 --> 00:01:29.522
Maybe with my drinks I'll be better.

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:32.022
(funky music)

00:01:32.114 --> 00:01:32.947
- Oh, wow!

00:01:32.947 --> 00:01:34.790
I did better than I thought, all right!

00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:37.728
- I gave him a 7.5 because
I thought that he was still

00:01:37.728 --> 00:01:38.779
on the music even though

00:01:38.779 --> 00:01:41.427
he was, like, super tired towards the end.

00:01:41.427 --> 00:01:42.382
(bell dings)

00:01:42.382 --> 00:01:46.481
Gave her a 8.5 because she's
on beat the whole time,

00:01:46.481 --> 00:01:50.007
and also she's storytelling
which a lot of people don't do.

00:01:50.007 --> 00:01:51.670
(bell dings)

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:53.190
- (laughs) That's very kind.

00:01:53.190 --> 00:01:54.761
- You use your space
great, you just gotta get

00:01:54.761 --> 00:01:55.594
out of your head.

00:01:55.594 --> 00:01:59.261
So I'm excited to see
what the tequila does.

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:01.719
(dance music)

00:02:01.719 --> 00:02:04.552
(people cheering)

00:02:11.837 --> 00:02:16.587
- (slowly speaking) We're getting drunk!

00:02:17.047 --> 00:02:19.380
(R&amp;B music)

00:02:28.366 --> 00:02:30.783
(funk music)

00:02:36.436 --> 00:02:38.686
- It's the Michael Jackson.

00:02:40.199 --> 00:02:43.032
(dancehall music)

00:02:43.217 --> 00:02:45.217
- [Brenda] Oh, watch it!

00:02:58.250 --> 00:02:59.108
(upbeat music)

00:02:59.108 --> 00:03:00.122
(bell dings)

00:03:00.122 --> 00:03:00.955
- Yeah!

00:03:01.269 --> 00:03:03.499
- I give an eight 'cause his musicality

00:03:03.499 --> 00:03:05.129
was actually a little bit better

00:03:05.129 --> 00:03:06.870
and also he had more confidence.

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:08.787
So I gave him an eight.

00:03:08.899 --> 00:03:10.266
(bell dings)

00:03:10.266 --> 00:03:11.266
- Aww, shit.

00:03:11.363 --> 00:03:13.255
- I feel like your
confidence in the last one

00:03:13.255 --> 00:03:17.186
was, like, up there, and you
were in your head this one.

00:03:17.186 --> 00:03:18.955
- [Jade] Brenda, look at your score!

00:03:18.955 --> 00:03:19.788
- What!

00:03:19.788 --> 00:03:22.087
(bell dings)

00:03:22.087 --> 00:03:23.287
- (squeals) Oh my god!

00:03:23.287 --> 00:03:24.948
- All of the confidence that you had...

00:03:24.948 --> 00:03:28.616
First of all, different human,
right now than it was before.

00:03:28.616 --> 00:03:30.737
And those hips, are you kidding me?

00:03:30.737 --> 00:03:33.228
Like, I... (stammers)

00:03:33.228 --> 00:03:34.061
That's what I have to say.

00:03:34.061 --> 00:03:35.088
(Brenda squeals)

00:03:35.088 --> 00:03:35.921
- [Clark] She made it rain.

00:03:35.921 --> 00:03:37.835
- [Bex] Yeah, yeah, it was good.

00:03:37.835 --> 00:03:40.335
(funky music)

